@xigyou Yes apptainer support multiple ports, looks like you have an error in your network configuration, the `bridge` name can be anything except an existing interface/bridge name like you here (`ens16f0`), so `00_bridge8.conflist` would look like this :

```
{
    "cniVersion": "1.0.0",
    "name": "bridge8",
    "plugins": [
        {
            "type": "bridge",
            "bridge": "bridge8",
            "isGateway": true,
            "ipMasq": true,
            "ipam": {
                "type": "host-local",
                "subnet": "192.168.8.0/16",
                "routes": [
                    { "dst": "0.0.0.0/0" }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "firewall"
        },
        {
            "type": "portmap",
            "capabilities": {"portMappings": true},
            "snat": true
        }
    ]
}
```

And to use this bridge, you have to specify it with `--network` parameter like this :

```
--net --network bridge8 --network-args "portmap=8929:8929/tcp" --network-args "portmap=2289:22/tcp"
```
